* A generic broadband seismometer, not that of any station: a pendulum with
* a period of 120 s and 0.707 of critical damping, 1500 V per m/s, recorded
* at 4e5 counts per volt.
* INPUT UNIT       : M/S
* OUTPUT UNIT      : COUNTS
ZEROS 2
POLES 2
  -3.7024e-02  +3.7024e-02
  -3.7024e-02  -3.7024e-02
CONSTANT  6.0e+08
